ump/status/12960183131045888","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:10355715596091393","platform":"x","post_id":"10355715596091393","published_at":"2010-12-02T15:32:49.000Z","text":"Tonight's episode of The Apprentice is one of the best ever--we're down to the final 3, and it's high excitement all the way. 10 pm on NBC.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/10355715596091393","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"}]